@startuml
title Plane State Diagram

[*] --> Order

state Order
Order : entry / newly acquired plane
Order : do / wait for delivery
Order : exit / delivered

state Arrival
Arrival : entry / plane arrives
Arrival : do / transition to preparation
Arrival : exit / prepared

state Preparation
Preparation : entry / plane is prepared
Preparation : do / assign to operations or maintenance
Preparation : exit / assigned

state Operations
Operations : entry / scheduled flights available
Operations : do / continue flying
Operations : exit / no more scheduled flights

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / maintenance required
Maintenance : do / check and service plane
Maintenance : exit / ready for preparation

state Withdrawn
Withdrawn : entry / permanently withdrawn from service
Withdrawn : do / remove from operations
Withdrawn : exit / none

Order --> Arrival : delivered
Arrival --> Preparation : prepared
Preparation --> Operations : assigned to operations
Preparation --> Maintenance : assigned to maintenance
Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights
Maintenance --> Preparation : ready for preparation
Operations --> Withdrawn : permanently withdrawn from service
Withdrawn --> [*] : none

@enduml
